    description: 'New York-developed dance-band Latin music synthesizing son cubano, mambo, and jazz horn arrangement; sophisticated piano-and-horn arrangements, soneo improvisation over montuno, large-ensemble back-line.',
    exemplars: ['Fania All-Stars', 'Hector Lavoe', 'Willie Colón'],
