    axes: { harm: 1, pitch: 1, ornament: 0, meter: 1, density: 1, transmission: 1, improv: 0, soundTech: 0, intensity: 1, voice: 1, timbre: 1, percussion: 1, cyclicity: 1 },
    description: 'British 1979-81 ska revival fusing punk-intensity with original Jamaican ska back-line; mixed-race lineups, anti-racist agitational subjects, hard-edged guitar-and-horn arrangements over ska off-beat skanks.',
    exemplars: ['The Specials', 'The Selecter', 'Madness'],
