    description: 'Polish "sung poetry" tradition setting literary-Polish poetry to original musical settings; piano-and-voice or guitar-and-voice intimate-cabaret-style delivery, Piwnica pod Baranami.',
    exemplars: ['Ewa Demarczyk', 'Marek Grechuta', 'Stare Dobre Małżeństwo'],
