    description: 'Newfoundland-Irish-and-English-derived balladic tradition centered on outport-fishing-community-song heritage; narrative seafaring-and-occupational-life subject matter, accordion-and-fiddle accompaniment.',
    exemplars: ['Great Big Sea', 'Figgy Duff', 'Anita Best'],
