    description: 'Minimalist sub-variant of tech-house emphasizing sparse arrangement and hypnotic-loop architecture; minimal-techno-derived percussion economy, very-long-form track structures, subterranean-club-DJ oriented.',
    exemplars: ['Ricardo Villalobos', 'Loco Dice', 'Luciano'],
    status: 'documented',
    crossRefs: ['experimentalElec.idmGlitch'],
