    description: 'Depressive-suicidal sub-style of black metal; slower tempo, dirge-melodic riffing, anguished-screamed vocal delivery often pushed to edge-of-articulation, despair-and-mortality lyric subjects, lo-fi cassette-recording aesthetic.',
    exemplars: ['Xasthur', 'Shining', 'Silencer'],
