    axes: { harm: 1, pitch: 1, ornament: 1, meter: 1, density: 1, transmission: 1, improv: 1, soundTech: 0, intensity: 0, voice: 2, timbre: 1, percussion: 1, cyclicity: 0 },
    description: '2010s indie rock continuation of the broader 2000s blogosphere indie wave, characterized by mid-fi production, broad-melodic guitar-and-vocal arrangements, and explicit-festival-targeting commercial visibility. Tame Impala\'s 2010-onward Australian psych-rock-pop hybrid, Vampire Weekend\'s Afro-influenced indie, the War on Drugs, Real Estate, and the broader Domino Records and Secretly Canadian label rosters anchor the canonical 2010s indie rock roster.',
