    description: 'Late-2010s indie-pop subgenre developed through SoundCloud-and-Bandcamp distributed-production scene, characterized by DIY-home-recorded production aesthetic, intimate-vocal-and-instrumental performance, and explicit lo-fi commercial-accessible cross-orientation. Clairo\'s Pretty Girl (2017), Cuco, Boy Pablo, Beabadoobee, Steve Lacy (transitional), and the broader Spotify "bedroom pop" playlist-driven scene anchor the canonical roster.',
