    description: 'Mid-1980s UK pop subgenre integrating jazz-and-soul harmonic vocabulary with sophisticated-glamorous-adult-pop aesthetic. Sade\'s Diamond Life (1984), the Style Council (Paul Weller post-Jam project), Everything but the Girl, Prefab Sprout, Working Week, and the broader UK-mainstream 1985-1989 chart-pop sophisti-pop wave constitute the canonical roster. Distinguished from broader 80s pop by sophisti-pop\'s explicit jazz-influence and adult-contemporary cultural orientation.',
