    description: '2010s-and-2020s international revival of late-1970s and 1980s Japanese city-pop genre through internet-distributed YouTube algorithm-circulation (especially the 2017 viral revival of Mariya Takeuchi\'s "Plastic Love"). Characterized by sophisticated jazz-and-fusion harmonic vocabulary, broad-AOR aesthetic (West-Coast Los Angeles 1970s session-musician influence transmitted through Tatsuro Yamashita and Haruomi Hosono), and explicit Tokyo-urban-1980s-economic-bubble nostalgia. Tomoo Nagai, Yumi Matsutoya, Anri are foundational; the modern revival scene includes Ginger Root, Night Tempo (city-pop edits), and broader vaporwave-adjacent producers.',
