    description: 'Japanese independent music scene developing from 1980s onward parallel to the J-pop mainstream industry. The Shimokitazawa neighborhood of Tokyo anchors institutional infrastructure. Number Girl (Hakata 1995-2002, 2019-onward), Toe (math-rock instrumental, Tokyo), Mono (post-rock instrumental, Tokyo), Lillies and Remains, and the broader Japan independent label network (P-Vine, Headz, Kakubarhythm) anchor the canonical roster.',
