    axes: { harm: 0, pitch: 1, ornament: 1, meter: -1, density: 2, transmission: 1, improv: 1, soundTech: -1, intensity: 2, voice: -1, timbre: 1, percussion: 2, cyclicity: 0 },
    description: '1990s heavy-metal subgenre extending traditional doom-metal slow-tempo into extreme funereal-tempo (typically 30-50 BPM, sometimes far slower) with explicit funeral-procession-funereal-rite thematic content. Thergothon (Finland 1990s), Skepticism (Finland), Esoteric (UK), Mournful Congregation (Australia), and Bell Witch constitute the canonical funeral doom roster. Distinguished from broader doom by funeral doom\'s extreme tempo and explicit funereal-grief register.',
