    description: 'Mid-1990s and onward black-metal subgenre emphasizing slow-tempo melancholic-and-suicidal-depressive thematic content. Bethlehem (Germany 1991-onward) inaugurated the canonical aesthetic; Shining (Sweden), Silencer, Xasthur (USA), Wigrid (Germany), and the broader European-and-American DSBM scene anchor the canonical roster. Distinguished from broader black metal by DSBM\'s slower-tempo emphasis and explicit depression-suicide thematic register.',
